rtion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0471245208\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000272 \"OBSOLETE, use term from Plant Ontology. A cell localized in the vascular cambium or phellogen. Its periclinal division can contribute cells either to the outside or to the inside of the axis; in vascular cambium, classified into fusiform initials (source of axial cells of xylem and phloem) and ray initials (source of the ray cells).\")\n6468:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000293 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3010>)\n6673:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000321 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1149>)\n7122:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000381 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1784>)\n7156:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000386 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3016>)\n7191:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000391 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1949>)\n7238:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000398 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1949>)\n7259:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000401 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1949>)\n7268:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000402 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/2869>)\n7288:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000405 <https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1621>)\n7436:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000426 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/708>)\n7555:SubClassOf(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000233 \"https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/1943\") obo:CL_0000441 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002162 obo:NCBITaxon_6656))\n7651:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000452 <https://github.com/obophenotype/cell-ontology/issues/3161>)\n7812:AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000233 obo:CL_0000473 <https://github.